# T-152-013 Execution Plan — Provider Health Matrix + Multi-Provider Readiness

## Goal
READ-ONLY audit of provider health and multi-provider readiness for Sprint 152 post-migration.

## Steps
1. Update heartbeat → sequence++ every phase
2. Gather evidence:
   - Claude CLI version + auth state
   - Codex CLI presence
   - Gemini CLI presence
   - Read model-registry.ts — 13 models × 3 providers × 4 tiers
   - Read provider.ts adapter interface
   - Read config.json for provider settings
   - Check env vars (OPENAI_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY)
   - Rate-limit behavior analysis (6 workers)
3. Write audit report to docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-013-provider-health.md
4. Write .result file with selfAssessment=DONE (read-only success)

## Non-Goals
- No source code changes
- No config mutations
- No network calls to external providers

## Output
- Report file with [PASS | FAIL | REGRESSION | MISSING | DRIFT] findings
- Sprint 153+ actionable list
- Provider matrix table
- Multi-provider activation roadmap
